},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me get all the rows to see what territories might be included.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01FCxUCuBompTFpMTkhcTnA5","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.select('state_name', 'state_abbr', 'farmers_markets')","limit":0}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":157,"cacheRead":17415,"cacheWrite":235,"totalTokens":17820,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.0007850000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0017415000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.00029375,"total":0.0028332500000000003},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":19},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912012632,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74EPMYX3csY21jqppEb","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01FCxUCuBompTFpMTkhcTnA5","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\",\"state_abbr\",\"farmers_markets\"\n\"California\",\"CA\",647\n\"New York\",\"NY\",555\n\"Pennsylvania\",\"PA\",426\n\"Minnesota\",\"MN\",390\n\"Illinois\",\"IL\",370\n\"Virginia\",\"VA\",336\n\"Wisconsin\",\"WI\",335\n\"Michigan\",\"MI\",321\n\"Massachusetts\",\"MA\",273\n\"Florida\",\"FL\",246\n\"Georgia\",\"GA\",231\n\"Ohio\",\"OH\",219\n\"Texas\",\"TX\",216\n\"Missouri\",\"MO\",208\n\"North Carolina\",\"NC\",196\n\"Iowa\",\"IA\",194\n\"Kentucky\",\"KY\",183\n\"Indiana\",\"IN\",181\n\"Colorado\",\"CO\",164\n\"Washington\",\"WA\",159\n\"Maryland\",\"MD\",140\n\"Connecticut\",\"CT\",124\n\"Kansas\",\"KS\",123\n\"Oregon\",\"OR\",122\n\"Alabama\",\"AL\",115\n\"Oklahoma\",\"OK\",102\n\"Arizona\",\"AZ\",97\n\"Tennessee\",\"TN\",95\n\"South Carolina\",\"SC\",86\n\"New Jersey\",\"NJ\",84\n\"Montana\",\"MT\",78\n\"Arkansas\",\"AR\",77\n\"Louisiana\",\"LA\",73\n\"Vermont\",\"VT\",71\n\"Alaska\",\"AK\",59\n\"Idaho\",\"ID\",59\n\"West Virginia\",\"WV\",57\n\"Wyoming\",\"WY\",57\n\"Nebraska\",\"NE\",55\n\"District Of Columbia\",\"DC\",54\n\"New Hampshire\",\"NH\",50\n\"Mississippi\",\"MS\",49\n\"Delaware\",\"DE\",49\n\"Maine\",\"ME\",43\n\"New Mexico\",\"NM\",34\n\"Rhode Island\",\"RI\",33\n\"Utah\",\"UT\",30\n\"Nevada\",\"NV\",28\n\"North Dakota\",\"ND\",18\n\"South Dakota\",\"SD\",17\n\"Hawaii\",\"HI\",13\n\"Puerto Rico\",\"PR\",2\n\"Virgin Islands\",\"VI\",0\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786912016262},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the data includes:\n- US states and DC\n- US territories: Puerto Rico (PR) and Virgin Islands (VI)\n\nThe user asked for \"total farmers markets (excl. territories)\", so I need to exclude Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands. I should include DC since it's part of the United States.\n\nNow I'll create a build script that:\n1. Sums all farmers markets excluding PR and VI\n2. Gets the 2025 US population\n3. Calculates the metric\n\nLet me create this derived metric script.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Bj9xacmKnbUxMQs5yUsfFi","name":"write","arguments":{"path":".xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_capita.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener()\n_o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]\nu.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\n# Read farmers markets data\nfm = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con, table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Read census population data\npop = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con, table_name=\"census_population\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Aggregate farmers markets (excluding territories: PR and VI)\nfm_total = (fm.filter(fm.state_abbr.notin(['PR', 'VI']))\n              .aggregate(total_markets=fm.farmers_markets.sum()))\n\n# Filter for US total population\nus_pop = pop.filter(pop.NAME == 'United States').select('POPESTIMATE2025')\n\n# Join on a constant key and calculate markets per 100k\nexpr = (\n    fm_total.join(us_pop, xo.literal(1) == xo.literal(1))\n      .mutate(markets_per_100k=fm_total.total_markets / us_pop.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n      .select('total_markets', 'POPESTIMATE2025', 'markets_per_100k')\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":680,"cacheRead":17650,"cacheWrite":596,"totalTokens":18939,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.0034000000000000002,"cacheRead":0.001765,"cacheWrite":0.000745,"total":0.005923},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":124},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912016263,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74Ed6Hj9mrhbwd71SQb","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01Bj9xacmKnbUxMQs5yUsfFi","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 1295 bytes to .xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_capita.py"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786912024491},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I'll build this script.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01YGAGy3vgbFVENHbaBVGWA4","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/trial-pi-37-pqw5e87j && xorq build .xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_capita.py --builds-dir .xorq/builds --emit-build-path-to /tmp/bp_metric.txt && cat /tmp/bp_metric.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":142,"cacheRead":18246,"cacheWrite":723,"totalTokens":19124,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.00071,"cacheRead":0.0018246000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.00090375,"total":0.00345135},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":12},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912024492,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74FEAgFrZu6KXJ9HCVN","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{